title: Add shared AURA authorizer utilities for JAM
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    Add cumulus-aura-authorizer-utils as part of upstreaming code from the
    parachain-service repository. Provides shared AURA authorization types,
    collator membership proofs, and work-package signing and verification for JAM.
    Update jam-std-common to 0.1.29 to match jam-types and keep Zombienet dependencies
    compatible when building workspace documentation.
    Qualify the std-only Storage references in sp-state-machine to avoid an unused
    import when checking the authorizer utilities without std.
crates:
- name: sp-state-machine
  bump: patch
- name: cumulus-aura-authorizer-utils
  bump: major
- name: polkadot-sdk
  bump: minor
